  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total Servicios Financieros: Senior Loan to Support MSMEs in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation aims to provide financing to Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;MSMEs&#x201d;) through factoring, leasing, and credit operations in Peru. The proposed financing will consist of: (i) a revolving unsecured loan of up to US$10 million to be funded by IDB Invest; and (ii) a senior B loan of up to US$10 million to be financed through a B-lender. The loan will have a term of up to three years.Additionally, the financing is expected to be accompanied by technical advisory services, defined jointly with the client, to help strengthen their sustainability strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation aims to provide financing to Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;MSMEs&#x201d;) through factoring, leasing, and credit operations in Peru. The proposed financing will consist of: (i) a revolving unsecured loan of up to US$10 million to be funded by IDB Invest; and (ii) a senior B loan of up to US$10 million to be financed through a B-lender. The loan will have a term of up to three years.Additionally, the financing is expected to be accompanied by technical advisory services, defined jointly with the client, to help strengthen their sustainability strategy.</narrative>
